### 2. Get All Non-Academic Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get Non-Academic Department By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{departmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Get Non-Academic Department By Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/code/{{departmentCode}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Get Non-Academic Departments By Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/type/{{departmentType}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Update Non-Academic Department
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{departmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main University Library Services",
  "description": "Updated university library and digital resource center"
}

### 7. Assign HOD / Director to Non-Academic Department
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{departmentId}}/hod
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hodId": "{{hodId}}"
}

### 8. Toggle Non-Academic Department Active Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{departmentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 9. Delete Non-Academic Department
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{departmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json